em\">Defender [Set D in your clan]</span></div><div align=\"center\">(Defend us when we are going to make a crime)</div><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;line-height:1.3em\">Farmer/Base defender [Set F in yout clan]</span></div><div align=\"center\">(Defend our contraband)</div><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;line-height:1.3em\">Attacker [Set A in your clan]</span></div><div align=\"center\">(The ones there help us with crimes)</div><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;line-height:1.3em\">Supplier [Set S in your clan]</span></div><div align=\"center\">(Give us Food,Guns,Ammo and tools to make the perfect crime)</div><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;line-height:1.3em\">Hitman [Set H in yout clan]</span></div><div align=\"center\">(Kill ppl with bounty and get money from it(Only 75%))</div><br/><div align=\"center\">i will add you to my steam group and tell you more and there you get the missions.</div><br/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;line-height:1.3em\">Bounty List</span></div><div align=\"center\">Th0maz (500)</div><br/><span style=\"font-size:20pt;line-height:1.3em\">There will come more jobs</span><br/>To sign in copy and answer this:<br/><br/>Player Name:<br/>Steam User Name (The one you sign in with):<br/>(not necessary) Steam User ID (If you want to be helped with unban):<br/>Job (Only one):<br/>Car:<br/>(not necessary) Microphone(Use at \"Ventrilo\"):<br/><br/>ps. when i have a car i will pay you for the good work<br/>ps.ps. you also get from the hostage money","sig":"<span class=\"img_missing\" title=\"This image was not archived by the Wayback Machine\">[image not archived]</span> <span class=\"img_missing\" title=\"This image was not archived by the Wayback Machine\">[image not archived]</span> <span class=\"img_missing\" title=\"This image was not archived by the Wayback Machine\">[image not archived]</span> <span class=\"img_missing\" title=